# This project deploys from the CLI (`vercel deploy --prod`), which uploads
# the working directory. Keep local secrets and dev-only files out of it:
# production's configuration lives in Vercel's environment variables, and
# the frontend is rebuilt remotely by vercel.json's buildCommand.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
backend/tests
backend/.tapetide_cache
frontend/dist
frontend/design-backups
